<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Everything you kept for later, newest first, from every conversation you were in — channels and private messages in one list. Nobody else can see it."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_star}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Opening it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Start ▸ Tools ▸ Saved Messages. It opens whether or not anything is in it, and tells you how to put something there."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_channels}>{dgettext("help_ui", "What a row does")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Each row says who wrote the line and where, and pressing it switches to that conversation and scrolls to the line. Remove takes the row away without touching the message. The note field beside it is yours: press Enter to keep it."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_reject}>{dgettext("help_ui", "A line that was deleted")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The row stays and says the message was deleted, without showing what it said. It disappears only if the message is removed from the server entirely."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_ui", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-saved-messages">
    {dgettext("help_ui", "Saving a Message")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
